00:18:37.123 --> 00:18:49.817
Ride time from learned speeds by zone and hour (or a routing engine with live traffic such as OSRM or GraphHopper, or a maps API), corrected by models trained on your riders' actual trips.

312
00:18:50.097 --> 00:18:59.867
The last 100 metres, gated complexes, lifts, security desks, often dominate the error, and only your own delivery history per building knows them.

313
00:19:00.147 --> 00:19:04.670
Live updates: once the rider is moving, their actual pace beats any prior.

314
00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:10.155
Update the ETA every few pings, and never let it count up suspiciously without explanation.

315
00:19:11.505 --> 00:19:16.689
Promises use the error distribution: promise the p80, p90, not the mean.

316
00:19:16.969 --> 00:19:24.649
