319
00:19:32.106 --> 00:19:42.069
The tracking service consumes the rider location topic filtered by active deliveries and pushes a smoothed position + ETA every ~3 to 5 s.

320
00:19:42.349 --> 00:19:53.677
Privacy: show the rider's position only during an active delivery, approximate the rider's position before pickup, and never show the customer's address to anyone but the assigned rider.

321
00:19:53.957 --> 00:19:57.349
Retain raw tracks for a limited time (Ch 36).

322
00:19:57.629 --> 00:20:06.994
Degradation: if updates stop (tunnel, dead battery), show last updated 1 min ago and extrapolate along the route, rather than freezing silently.

