00:23:39.157 --> 00:24:00.939
Decision, Polygon serviceability compiled into grid or H3 indexes; telemetry through Kafka into an order-safe, batched, thinned Redis live index; dispatch with predicted availability, batching and periodic matching; ETAs from zone times hour speeds, building door times and live pace; SSE tracking with privacy rules.

374
00:24:02.289 --> 00:24:16.283
Related ADRs, ADR-330 Serviceability polygons, versioned, compiled to 500 m grid or H3 res 8 per city (L1); ADR-331 Telemetry:

