00:24:16.563 --> 00:24:35.187
Kafka keyed by rider, Lua timestamp-guarded updates, batches of 200, movement thinning for the live index (L2); ADR-332 Dispatch every 15 s per store cluster: min-cost matching over packed + soon-packed orders and present + returning riders,

376
00:24:35.467 --> 00:24:56.033
max 2-order batches within 1 km (L3); ADR-333 ETA = learned ride + learned door time, live re-estimation; promise at p85 (L4); ADR-334 Tracking via SSE only during active deliveries; raw tracks retained 30 days.

